<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee steady vs dollar, firms vs stg.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee steady vs dollar, firms vs stg.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was steady against dollar and firmer against sterling on Wednesday reflecting international market trends, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a commercial mean rate of 20.9275 to the dollar from 20.9295 on Tuesday, and at 34.7175 to the sterling from 34.8665.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555.</p>
</text>
